        <UserObject label="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CertAutomation - self-Signed Issuer Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;cert-manager 内部是多资源、多组件协作的 reconcile 链。self-signed 的完整流程如下:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ① ArgoCD/Helm apply chart&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;├─ 创建 Issuer:&amp;nbsp; cosign-webhook-selfsigned-issuer (selfSigned: {})&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;└─ 创建 Certificate: cosign-webhook-cert&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ② cert-manager 的 certificates controller 监听到 Certificate&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; 检查:secretName(cosign-webhook-tls)里还没有有效证���&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ③ controller 生成私钥,并创建一个 CertificateRequest (CR)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; CR 里含 CSR(证书签名请求),issuerRef 指向 selfSigned Issuer&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ④ certificaterequests controller 按 issuerRef 找到 selfSigned Issuer&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ⑤ ★ selfSigned 签发逻辑:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; 用【第③步刚生成的那把私钥】给 CSR 签名&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; → subject == issuer(自己签自己),无上级 CA&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; → 证书 SAN = dnsNames 里的两个 .svc 名&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ⑥ 签发结果写回 CertificateRequest.status.certificate&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ⑦ certificates controller 把最终材料写入 Secret: cosign-webhook-tls&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;├─ tls.crt&amp;nbsp; (leaf,自签)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;├─ tls.key&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;└─ ca.crt&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;(self-signed 场景下 ≈ leaf 自身)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ⑧ cainjector 读该 Secret 的 ca.crt → 注入 VWC 的 caBundle&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; │&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; ⑨ webhook Pod mount cosign-webhook-tls → gunicorn 用 tls.crt/tls.key 起 HTTPS" link="cert-manager 内部是多资源、多组件协作的 reconcile 链。self-signed 的完整流程如下:&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;  ① ArgoCD/Helm apply chart&#xa;     ├─ 创建 Issuer:  cosign-webhook-selfsigned-issuer (selfSigned: {})&#xa;     └─ 创建 Certificate: cosign-webhook-cert&#xa;          │&#xa;  ② cert-manager 的 certificates controller 监听到 Certificate&#xa;          │  检查:secretName(cosign-webhook-tls)里还没有有效证���&#xa;          │&#xa;  ③ controller 生成私钥,并创建一个 CertificateRequest (CR)&#xa;          │  CR 里含 CSR(证书签名请求),issuerRef 指向 selfSigned Issuer&#xa;          │&#xa;  ④ certificaterequests controller 按 issuerRef 找到 selfSigned Issuer&#xa;          │&#xa;  ⑤ ★ selfSigned 签发逻辑:&#xa;          │  用【第③步刚生成的那把私钥】给 CSR 签名&#xa;          │  → subject == issuer(自己签自己),无上级 CA&#xa;          │  → 证书 SAN = dnsNames 里的两个 .svc 名&#xa;          │&#xa;  ⑥ 签发结果写回 CertificateRequest.status.certificate&#xa;          │&#xa;  ⑦ certificates controller 把最终材料写入 Secret: cosign-webhook-tls&#xa;          │     ├─ tls.crt  (leaf,自签)&#xa;          │     ├─ tls.key&#xa;          │     └─ ca.crt   (self-signed 场景下 ≈ leaf 自身)&#xa;          │&#xa;  ⑧ cainjector 读该 Secret 的 ca.crt → 注入 VWC 的 caBundle&#xa;          │&#xa;  ⑨ webhook Pod mount cosign-webhook-tls → gunicorn 用 tls.crt/tls.key 起 HTTPS" id="3aCiBKkC7WA8m6Gg0PLg-16">
          <mxCell style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1220" y="210" width="490" height="460" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
